{"seq":1,"slug":"i18n-testing-automation","title":"国际化测试与自动化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-internationalization/operations/i18n-testing-automation","wordCount":1324,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"国际化测试与自动化\">国际化测试与自动化</h1><p>i18n 缺陷的诡异之处在于它们只在特定 locale 下才暴露——英语测试全绿，但德语因字符串膨胀撑破 UI、阿拉伯语因 RTL 方向翻转导致数据错位、日语因字体回退显示方块。后端 i18n 测试的目标是在部署前系统性地捕获这些 locale 特定的失败。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>伪本地化</strong>：不需要真实翻译就能暴露硬编码字符串、截断、拼接等缺陷的最高 ROI 技术</li>\n<li><strong>CI 质量门</strong>：资源完整性、占位符一致性、MessageFormat 语法校验、编码验证集成到每次 MR</li>\n<li><strong>Locale 参数化测试</strong>：格式化函数用代表性 locale 子集（en/de/ja/ar/hi）覆盖关键差异</li>\n<li><strong>翻译覆盖率度量</strong>：加权覆盖率比简单 key 计数更能反映业务优先级</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"伪本地化-pseudo-localization\">伪本地化（Pseudo-localization）</h2><p>伪本地化是最高 ROI 的 i18n 测试技术——它不需要任何真实翻译，却能暴露大部分 i18n 缺陷。</p>\n<p>原理：自动将源语言字符串转换为一种人工「假语言」，保持可读性的同时模拟翻译后的特征：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>转换</th>\n<th>目的</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>字符替换 (accents)</td>\n<td>暴露硬编码字符串</td>\n<td><code>Hello</code> → <code>[Ĥëľľö]</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>字符串膨胀 (~30-50%)</td>\n<td>模拟德语/芬兰语长度</td>\n<td><code>Save</code> → <code>[Šåvë________]</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>包围标记</td>\n<td>检测截断和拼接</td>\n<td><code>Save</code> → <code>[!!!Šåvë!!!]</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RTL 标记</td>\n<td>模拟阿拉伯语方向</td>\n<td>添加 RLM/LRM 控制字符</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CJK 替换</td>\n<td>测试宽字符渲染</td>\n<td><code>Save</code> → <code>[保存已完成了]</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 后端伪本地化生成器&#10;function pseudoLocalize(source: string, options: PseudoOptions): string {&#10;  let result = source;&#10;&#10;  // 保留变量占位符不变&#10;  const placeholders = extractPlaceholders(result); // {name}, %s, $count 等&#10;&#10;  // 字符替换（保持可读）&#10;  result = result.replace(/[a-zA-Z]/g, (char) =&gt; ACCENT_MAP[char] ?? char);&#10;&#10;  // 字符串膨胀（按源长度的比例）&#10;  const padding = &#39;~&#39;.repeat(Math.ceil(source.length * options.expansionRatio));&#10;  result = `[${result}${padding}]`;&#10;&#10;  // 恢复占位符&#10;  restorePlaceholders(result, placeholders);&#10;&#10;  return result;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 后端伪本地化生成器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> pseudoLocalize</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">source</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">options</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PseudoOptions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> source;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 保留变量占位符不变</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> placeholders</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> extractPlaceholders</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(result); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// {name}, %s, $count 等</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 字符替换（保持可读）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">replace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">[a-zA-Z]</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">g</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">char</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ACCENT_MAP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[char] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> char);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 字符串膨胀（按源长度的比例）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> padding</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '~'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">repeat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ceil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(source.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> options.expansionRatio));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `[${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">result</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">padding</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}]`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 恢复占位符</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  restorePlaceholders</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(result, placeholders);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>伪本地化能检测到的问题：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[Pseudo-localization] --&gt; B[Hardcoded strings&lt;br/&gt;未参数化的文本]&#10;    A --&gt; C[String truncation&lt;br/&gt;固定宽度截断翻译]&#10;    A --&gt; D[Concatenation&lt;br/&gt;字符串拼接]&#10;    A --&gt; E[Missing context&lt;br/&gt;同一 key 不同含义]&#10;    A --&gt; F[Encoding issues&lt;br/&gt;非 ASCII 处理错误]&#10;    A --&gt; G[Broken interpolation&lt;br/&gt;变量占位符被破坏]\">graph TD\n    A[Pseudo-localization] --&gt; B[Hardcoded strings&lt;br/&gt;未参数化的文本]\n    A --&gt; C[String truncation&lt;br/&gt;固定宽度截断翻译]\n    A --&gt; D[Concatenation&lt;br/&gt;字符串拼接]\n    A --&gt; E[Missing context&lt;br/&gt;同一 key 不同含义]\n    A --&gt; F[Encoding issues&lt;br/&gt;非 ASCII 处理错误]\n    A --&gt; G[Broken interpolation&lt;br/&gt;变量占位符被破坏]</pre><h2 id=\"自动化-i18n-检查的类型\">自动化 i18n 检查的类型</h2><p>后端 CI 管道中应集成的 i18n 自动化检查：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>检查类型</th>\n<th>工具/方法</th>\n<th>检测目标</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>硬编码字符串扫描</td>\n<td>AST 分析 / regex</td>\n<td>未提取到资源文件的用户可见文本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资源文件完整性</td>\n<td>diff-based</td>\n<td>源语言新增 key 是否在所有目标 locale 存在</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>占位符一致性</td>\n<td>解析比对</td>\n<td>翻译中的占位符与源文件是否匹配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ICU 语法校验</td>\n<td>MessageFormat parser</td>\n<td>复数/选择语法是否合法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长度校验</td>\n<td>规则引擎</td>\n<td>翻译是否超出 max_length 约束</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>编码校验</td>\n<td>byte scan</td>\n<td>资源文件是否为合法 UTF-8</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>术语一致性</td>\n<td>termbase 比对</td>\n<td>同一术语是否在所有消息中一致使用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# CI pipeline: i18n 质量门&#10;i18n-checks:&#10;  stage: test&#10;  script:&#10;    # 1. 资源文件完整性&#10;    - i18n-lint check-missing --source locales/en --targets locales/*&#10;    # 2. MessageFormat 语法校验&#10;    - i18n-lint validate-syntax --format icu --dir locales/&#10;    # 3. 伪本地化生成 + 截断检测&#10;    - i18n-lint pseudo --expansion 1.5 --check-truncation&#10;    # 4. 硬编码字符串扫描&#10;    - i18n-lint scan-hardcoded --src src/ --exclude &quot;*.test.*&quot;&#10;  rules:&#10;    - if: $CI_MERGE_REQUEST_ID\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># CI pipeline: i18n 质量门</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">i18n-checks</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  stage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  script</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 1. 资源文件完整性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">i18n-lint check-missing --source locales/en --targets locales/*</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 2. MessageFormat 语法校验</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">i18n-lint validate-syntax --format icu --dir locales/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 3. 伪本地化生成 + 截断检测</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">i18n-lint pseudo --expansion 1.5 --check-truncation</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 4. 硬编码字符串扫描</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">i18n-lint scan-hardcoded --src src/ --exclude \"*.test.*\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  rules</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">$CI_MERGE_REQUEST_ID</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"翻译覆盖率度量\">翻译覆盖率度量</h2><p>翻译覆盖率是衡量 i18n 完整度的核心指标：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>coverage</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>locale</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mtext>translated_keys</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>locale</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mtext>source_keys</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{coverage}(\\text{locale}) = \\frac{|\\text{translated\\_keys}(\\text{locale})|}{|\\text{source\\_keys}|} \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">coverage</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">locale</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.446em;vertical-align:-0.996em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">source_keys</span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">translated_keys</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">locale</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.996em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>但简单的 key 计数不够——需要加权：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>weighted_coverage</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>translated</mtext></mrow></munder><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>all</mtext></mrow></munder><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{weighted\\_coverage} = \\frac{\\sum_{k \\in \\text{translated}} w(k)}{\\sum_{k \\in \\text{all}} w(k)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">weighted_coverage</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4802em;vertical-align:-1.0131em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4671em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">all</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3271em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7171em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">translated</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3271em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0131em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w(k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是 key 的权重，可基于：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>使用频率</strong>：高流量页面的 key 权重高</li>\n<li><strong>可见度</strong>：主路径 &gt; 错误消息 &gt; 辅助文本</li>\n<li><strong>业务影响</strong>：支付流程 &gt; 帮助页面</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>公式</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Key 覆盖率</td>\n<td>translated / total keys</td>\n<td>粗粒度进度跟踪</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加权覆盖率</td>\n<td>weighted sum</td>\n<td>业务优先级对齐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>新鲜度</td>\n<td>keys where source changed after translation</td>\n<td>翻译过时检测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一致性分数</td>\n<td>consistent term usage / total term occurrences</td>\n<td>术语统一度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"locale-特定的功能测试\">locale 特定的功能测试</h2><p>某些业务逻辑在特定 locale 下有不同行为，需要 locale 参数化的测试：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 参数化测试：货币格式化&#10;describe(&#39;formatCurrency&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;  const cases: [string, number, string, string][] = [&#10;    [&#39;en-US&#39;, 1234.56, &#39;USD&#39;, &#39;$1,234.56&#39;],&#10;    [&#39;de-DE&#39;, 1234.56, &#39;EUR&#39;, &#39;1.234,56\\u00A0€&#39;],&#10;    [&#39;ja-JP&#39;, 1234, &#39;JPY&#39;, &#39;￥1,234&#39;],&#10;    [&#39;ar-SA&#39;, 1234.56, &#39;SAR&#39;, &#39;١٬٢٣٤٫٥٦\\u00A0ر.س.&#39;],&#10;    [&#39;hi-IN&#39;, 1234567, &#39;INR&#39;, &#39;₹12,34,567&#39;],&#10;  ];&#10;&#10;  test.each(cases)(&#39;locale=%s amount=%d currency=%s → %s&#39;, (locale, amount, currency, expected) =&gt; {&#10;    expect(formatCurrency(amount, currency, locale)).toBe(expected);&#10;  });&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 参数化测试：货币格式化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">describe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'formatCurrency'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> cases</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">][] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'en-US'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1234.56</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'USD'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'$1,234.56'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'de-DE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1234.56</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'EUR'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1.234,56</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\u00A0</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">€'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ja-JP'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1234</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'JPY'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'￥1,234'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ar-SA'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1234.56</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SAR'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'١٬٢٣٤٫٥٦</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\u00A0</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ر.س.'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'hi-IN'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1234567</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'INR'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'₹12,34,567'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  test.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">each</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cases)(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'locale=%s amount=%d currency=%s → %s'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">locale</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">currency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">expected</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    expect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">formatCurrency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount, currency, locale)).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toBe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(expected);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键测试维度：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>测试用例</th>\n<th>覆盖的 bug 类型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>复数规则</td>\n<td>0, 1, 2, 5, 21, 100</td>\n<td>复数类别遗漏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日期格式</td>\n<td>各 locale 的长/短格式</td>\n<td>格式字符串错误</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时区</td>\n<td>DST 切换日、UTC±12</td>\n<td>偏移计算错误</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>排序</td>\n<td>locale 特定字符对</td>\n<td>collation 配置错误</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文本方向</td>\n<td>混合 LTR+RTL 内容</td>\n<td>BiDi 标记缺失</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"视觉回归测试\">视觉回归测试</h2><p>后端生成的 HTML 邮件、PDF 报告需要视觉回归测试来检测 locale 切换后的渲染问题：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[Backend renders&lt;br/&gt;HTML email] --&gt; B[Playwright screenshot&lt;br/&gt;per locale]&#10;    B --&gt; C[Compare with&lt;br/&gt;baseline snapshots]&#10;    C --&gt; D{Diff &gt; threshold?}&#10;    D --&gt;|Yes| E[Flag for review]&#10;    D --&gt;|No| F[Pass]\">flowchart LR\n    A[Backend renders&lt;br/&gt;HTML email] --&gt; B[Playwright screenshot&lt;br/&gt;per locale]\n    B --&gt; C[Compare with&lt;br/&gt;baseline snapshots]\n    C --&gt; D{Diff &gt; threshold?}\n    D --&gt;|Yes| E[Flag for review]\n    D --&gt;|No| F[Pass]</pre><p>视觉测试的 locale 覆盖策略不需要测试所有语言——选择代表性子集：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>英语</strong>：基准</li>\n<li><strong>德语</strong>：最长平均翻译（+30%）</li>\n<li><strong>日语/中文</strong>：CJK 宽字符 + 竖排可能性</li>\n<li><strong>阿拉伯语</strong>：RTL + 阿拉伯数字</li>\n<li><strong>泰语</strong>：无词间空格 + 声调标记</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"持续监控与报警\">持续监控与报警</h2><p>部署后的 i18n 健康度监控：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>阈值</th>\n<th>报警条件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Missing translation rate</td>\n<td>&lt;5% per locale</td>\n<td>新部署后某 locale fallback 突增</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Locale resolution failure</td>\n<td>&lt;0.1%</td>\n<td>无法确定 locale 的请求比例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Encoding error rate</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>任何 UTF-8 解析失败</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Format error rate</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>MessageFormat 模板解析失败</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pseudo-leak rate</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>伪本地化文本泄露到生产</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一项尤其重要：如果伪本地化作为一个可选 locale 存在于系统中（如 <code>en-XA</code>），必须确保它不会在生产环境对真实用户可见。CI 的硬编码字符串扫描与伪本地化是互补的——前者检测遗漏的提取，后者检测系统对非 ASCII 文本的处理能力。关于这些检查在 RTL 语言场景下的特殊考量，参见<a href=\"rtl-bidirectional-support\">RTL 与双向文本支持</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>i18n 测试的分层策略：伪本地化在最低成本下暴露最广泛的缺陷（硬编码、截断、拼接）；CI 质量门在每次变更时自动验证资源完整性和语法正确性；locale 参数化的功能测试覆盖格式化逻辑的 locale 特定行为；视觉回归测试捕获渲染层问题。部署后的持续监控（translation miss rate、encoding error rate）提供生产环境的 i18n 健康度反馈闭环。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"国际化测试与自动化","id":"国际化测试与自动化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"伪本地化（Pseudo-localization）","id":"伪本地化-pseudo-localization"},{"level":2,"text":"自动化 i18n 检查的类型","id":"自动化-i18n-检查的类型"},{"level":2,"text":"翻译覆盖率度量","id":"翻译覆盖率度量"},{"level":2,"text":"locale 特定的功能测试","id":"locale-特定的功能测试"},{"level":2,"text":"视觉回归测试","id":"视觉回归测试"},{"level":2,"text":"持续监控与报警","id":"持续监控与报警"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"复数化与语法适配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-internationalization/content-translation/pluralization-gender-grammar"},"next":{"title":"RTL 与双向文本支持","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-internationalization/operations/rtl-bidirectional-support"}}